#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs offers support for projects on our :doc:`Read the Docs "
"Business </commercial/index>` and |org_brand| platforms. We're happy to "
"assist with any questions or problems you have using either of our "
"platforms."
